# The e2e stack's second simulated device, "snmpsim-02" (#111).
#
# snmpsim serves each file under its community: this one answers community
# "second" on the same agent as public.snmprec. It exists so the fleet views
# have more than one device to list, and it differs from the first where a
# fleet view would show it: another name, and its second interface down.
# Format: OID|Type|Value (see public.snmprec)

